    <preface xml:id="pr-abstract">
      <title>Abstract</title>
      <p>
        This text provides an introduction to the theory of invariant rings, with an emphasis on foundational concepts, such as Gröbner Bases, and common computational techniques. Special focus is given to practical applications using the <url href="https://macaulay2.com/doc/Macaulay2/share/doc/Macaulay2/InvariantRing/html/index.html">InvariantRings Package</url> in Macaulay2, providing a hands-on approach to exploring computational invariant theory. 
      </p>
    </preface>

